      <MissionDesc>International Bipolar Foundation empowers individuals living with bipolar disorder and their caregivers by providing advocacy, education, support, and awarenessfostering a caring community and stigma-free world where mental health is equitably acknowledged and treated. IBPF envisions wellness, dignity, and respect for the over 60 million people living with bipolar disorder.</MissionDesc>
